OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed after cyclist killed
OL,4,Ain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who caused the death of a
OL,7,Fcyclist after she struck him in a
OL,8,F"wholly avoidable" crash has been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FAyan Kolah, 38, struck Robert Jones,
OL,12,F64, from Melksham, on the morning of 20
OL,13,FJanuary as he cycled in high-vis
OL,14,Fclothing on the northbound carriageway
OL,15,Fof the A350 near Lacock in Wiltshire.
OL,17,FWiltshire Police said when officers
OL,18,Farrived at the scene Kolah appeared
OL,19,F"erratic" and was found with a small
OL,20,Famount of cannabis, a grinder and an
OL,21,Fopen bottle of vodka.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
