OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed after cyclist killed
OL,4,Ain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FKolah, from Lowden in Chippenham, was
OL,7,Fsentenced to five years and eight
OL,8,Fmonths in prison after she pleaded
OL,9,Fguilty to causing death by careless
OL,10,Fdriving and failing to provide a
OL,11,Fspecimen at Swindon Crown Court on
OL,12,FThursday.
